{%- comment -%}
  Display name for a variant, for choosers only (chips and option selects).

  The supplier's option values repeat the size on every option ("Black 15ml",
  "Citrus 15ml Men") even though every option is the same 15 ml bottle and
  the product title already says so. Choosers show just the part that
  differs: "Black", "Citrus (men's)". Values without those patterns pass
  through untouched. The cart, checkout and order emails keep Shopify's own
  variant title — this changes a label, never the data.

  Usage: {% render 'zvlabel', t: variant.title %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign out = t | replace: ' 15ml', '' | replace: '15ml ', '' | replace: ' 15 ml', ''
  assign out = out | replace: ' Men', ' (men’s)' | replace: ' Women', ' (women’s)' | strip
  if out == blank
    assign out = t
  endif
-%}
{{- out | escape -}}
